  "sourceFile": "\"2026-Diocesan-Prayer-Cycle.pdf\", fetched directly from https://ecww.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2026-Diocesan-Prayer-Cycle.pdf, linked from https://ecww.org/diocesan-cycle-of-prayer/.",
